return {
    ["5230279   廷根   位面"] = "5230279 Tingen Plane",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>我已步入非凡！</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>养成-成长\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>晋升至序列9"] = "<Assistant_Title1>I Have Stepped into the Extraordinary!</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Growth - Development\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Advance to Sequence 9",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>暗夜丝绒・蝶舞花饰・宽摆晚礼裙\n仲夏夜仙境中，划过天空的不仅有精灵的双翼，还有纷飞的诗心。"] = "<DecH>Craftsmanship: </>Dark Night Velvet · Butterfly Flower Ornaments · Wide-hem Evening Gown\nIn the midsummer night wonderland, what streaks across the sky is not only the wings of elves, but also the fluttering poetic heart.",
    ["<Highlight>{1,2,（烙印已失效）}</>攻击提高<Mark>210</>，防御降低<Mark>15</>。使装备者获得威瑟尔家族的<Mark>美德</>。进入战斗时，每有一个小队成员拥有威瑟尔家族的<Mark>美德</>，攻击额外提高<Mark>10</>。\n激活套装<Mark>铁与血誓约</>时不生效。"] = "<Highlight>{1,2,(Brand Expired)}</>Attack increased by <Mark>210</>, Defense decreased by <Mark>15</>. Grants the wearer the <Mark>Virtue</> of the Weil Family. Upon entering combat, for every squad member possessing the <Mark>Virtue</> of the Weil Family, Attack is additionally increased by <Mark>10</>. \nDoes not take effect when the <Mark>Covenant of Iron and Blood</> set is active.",
    ["<P_Heart>（不知道“月亮”先生能否预知我的到来？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(I wonder if Mr. Moon could have foreseen my arrival?)</>",
    ["<Yellow>公证</>：携带者在战斗中施放普通技能和终结技能时，自动触发对该技能的公证，分别有<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=1?80%/10%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=2?65%/15%/10%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=3?50%/20%/20%}</>的概率公证成功，获得<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=1?1/2}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=2?1/2/3}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=3?1/2/3}</>层公证。有10%概率公证失败，失去1层公证。每层公证使携带者提高<Yellow>*f</>攻击和<Yellow>*f</>技能增强。\n公证最多可累积<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=1?40}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=2?50}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=3?60}</>层。技能触发的公证超出层数上限时，超出的层数自动消耗，每层使该技能本次施放的增伤提高<Yellow>10%</>，治疗增幅提高<Yellow>10%</>。\n离开场景时，清除所有公证层数。"] = "<Yellow>Notarization</>: When the carrier casts basic skills and Finisher Skills in combat, Notarization of the skill is automatically triggered, with a <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=1?80%/10%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=2?65%/15%/10%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=3?50%/20%/20%}</> probability of successful Notarization, granting <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=1?1/2}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=2?1/2/3}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=3?1/2/3}</> stack(s) of Notarization. There is a 10% probability of failure, losing 1 stack of Notarization. Each stack of Notarization increases the carrier's Attack by <Yellow>*f</> and Skill Enhancement by <Yellow>*f</>. \nNotarization can accumulate up to <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=1?40}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=2?50}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=3?60}</> stacks. When the stacks triggered by skills exceed the maximum limit, the excess stacks are automatically consumed, each stack increasing the Damage Boost of the current skill cast by <Yellow>10%</> and Healing Boost by <Yellow>10%</>. \nWhen leaving the scene, all Notarization stacks are cleared.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>积分说明</>\n在<Highlight>战略服筛选阶段</>的联赛前两轮，将启用战略服筛选积分规则。只有<Highlight>神话组</>的俱乐部可获得战略服筛选积分。战略服筛选积分与用于判定当前比赛胜负的<Highlight>局内积分相互独立</>。局内积分用于决定当前比赛的胜负与名次；战略服筛选积分根据每场比赛名次及每轮最终排名累计，用于决定俱乐部的战略服筛选排名与晋级资格。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>单场名次积分</>\n每场比赛结束后，根据俱乐部在该场比赛中的最终名次获得战略服筛选积分：\n<Highlight>第1名：30分</>\n<Highlight>第2名：15分</>\n<Highlight>第3名：10分</>\n<Highlight>第4名：5分</>\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>第一轮最终排名积分</>\n第一轮全部比赛结束后，根据俱乐部最终排名额外获得战略服筛选积分：\n<Highlight>第1名：60分</>\n<Highlight>第2名：50分</>\n<Highlight>第3名：45分</>\n<Highlight>第4名：40分</>\n<Highlight>第5至第8名：10分</>\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>第二轮最终排名积分</>\n第二轮全部比赛结束后，根据俱乐部最终排名额外获得战略服筛选积分：\n<Highlight>第1名：200分</>\n<Highlight>第2名：100分</>\n<Highlight>第3名：70分</>\n<Highlight>第4名：50分</>\n<Highlight>第5至第8名：15分</>\n战略服筛选阶段的联赛前两轮结束后，将根据各俱乐部累计获得的<Highlight>战略服筛选总积分</>进行排名。本赛区战略服筛选总积分<Highlight>前4名</>的俱乐部将晋级<Highlight>四方联赛天启组</>，并获得<Highlight>参与战略服</>的资格。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>同分排序规则</>\n战略服筛选排名优先按照<Highlight>战略服筛选总积分</>由高到低排列。总积分相同时：第一轮或第二轮联赛结束后，按照俱乐部在本轮的<Highlight>最终排名</>排序，排名靠前者优先；四方联赛每轮第一场比赛结束后，本轮尚未产生最终排名，同分俱乐部暂不区分排名先后，当前展示顺序不代表本轮最终排名。\n"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Points Explanation </> \n During the first two rounds of the league in the <Highlight> Strategic Server Screening Stage </>, the Strategic Server screening point rules will be enabled. Only Clubs in the <Highlight> Mythical Group </> can earn Strategic Server screening points. Strategic Server screening points are independent of the <Highlight> In-Match Points </> used to determine the outcome of the current match. In-Match Points are used to determine the outcome and placement of the current match; Strategic Server screening points are accumulated based on the placement in each match and the final ranking of each round, and are used to determine the Club's Strategic Server screening ranking and eligibility for advancement. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Single-Match Placement Points </> \n After each match, Strategic Server screening points are awarded based on the Club's final placement in that match: \n <Highlight> 1st place: 30 points </> \n <Highlight> 2nd place: 15 points </> \n <Highlight> 3rd place: 10 points </> \n <Highlight> 4th place: 5 points </> \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> First Round Final Ranking Points </> \n After all matches in the first round are completed, additional Strategic Server screening points are awarded based on the Club's final ranking: \n <Highlight> 1st place: 60 points </> \n <Highlight> 2nd place: 50 points </> \n <Highlight> 3rd place: 45 points </> \n <Highlight> 4th place: 40 points </> \n <Highlight> 5th to 8th place: 10 points </> \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Second Round Final Ranking Points </> \n After all matches in the second round are completed, additional Strategic Server screening points are awarded based on the Club's final ranking: \n <Highlight> 1st place: 200 points </> \n <Highlight> 2nd place: 100 points </> \n <Highlight> 3rd place: 70 points </> \n <Highlight> 4th place: 50 points </> \n <Highlight> 5th to 8th place: 15 points </> \n After the first two rounds of the league in the Strategic Server screening stage are completed, rankings will be based on the <Highlight> Total Strategic Server Screening Points </> accumulated by each Club. The top <Highlight> 4 Clubs </> in this warzone's total Strategic Server screening points will advance to the <Highlight> Four-Way League Apocalypse Group </> and earn the qualification to <Highlight> participate in the Strategic Server </>. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Tie-breaking Rules </> \n Strategic Server screening rankings are prioritized by <Highlight> Total Strategic Server Screening Points </> from highest to lowest. When total points are equal: after the first or second round of the league ends, the ranking is based on the Club's <Highlight> Final Ranking </> in that round, with the higher rank taking priority; after the first match of each Four-Way League round, the final ranking for the round has not yet been determined, so tied Clubs are not distinguished by rank, and the current display order does not represent the final ranking for the round. \n",
