    ["在目标区域降下星沙，对范围内的敌方造成spellfielddisc(*id)点魔法伤害，同时使敌方buffdisc(*id)，持续10秒。施法后获得20点<HighLight>神秘知识</>。自身拥有<HighLight>知识灌注</>时，本技能获得<HighLight>强化</>。\n\n<FaintYellow>强化</>：星沙降下造成spellfielddisc(*id)点魔法伤害后持续存在，每<HighLight>0.7</>秒造成spellfielddisc(*id)点魔法伤害并有<HighLight>90%</>的基础概率附加一层持续<HighLight>2</>秒的<HighLight>buffname(*id)</>，一共<HighLight>3</>次；最终<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\">浮空</>范围内的敌方怪物目标，并对范围内的敌方造成spellfielddisc(*id)点魔法伤害，敌方每拥有一层<HighLight>buffname(*id)</>，该伤害增加<HighLight>10%</>。\n<FaintYellow>buffname(*id)</>：最多叠加<HighLight>3</>层，buffdisc(*id)。\n<FaintYellow>神秘知识</>：最多拥有100点。达到100点时解锁<HighLight>终结技能信息洪流</>。"] = "Rain down Star Sand on the target area, dealing spellfielddisc(*id) magic damage to enemies within the range and applying buffdisc(*id) for 10 seconds. Gain 20 points of Mysterious Knowledge <HighLight></> after casting. When you possess Knowledge Infusion <HighLight></>, this skill gains Strengthening <HighLight></>. \n\n<FaintYellow> Strengthening </>: Star Sand remains after dealing spellfielddisc(*id) magic damage, dealing spellfielddisc(*id) magic damage every 0.7 <HighLight></> seconds and having a 90% <HighLight></> base probability of applying one layer of buffname(*id) <HighLight></> for 2 <HighLight></> seconds, for a total of 3 <HighLight></> times; finally, launch enemy monsters within the range into the air <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\"></> and deal spellfielddisc(*id) magic damage to enemies in the range, with damage increased by 10% <HighLight></> for each layer of buffname(*id) <HighLight></> the enemy possesses. \n<FaintYellow> buffname(*id) </>: Maximum of 3 <HighLight></> layers, buffdisc(*id). \n<FaintYellow> Mysterious Knowledge </>: Maximum of 100 points. Upon reaching 100 points, unlock the Finisher Skill Vortex of Knowledge <HighLight></>.",
