    ["瓷碗、木筐、铁盒……人们的日常用品被安置在湖水深处，像是谁的珍藏。 "] = "Porcelain bowls, wooden crates, iron boxes... People's daily necessities are placed in the depths of the lake, as if they were someone's collection.",
