    ["竟然还有这么多参考文献？<P_Yellow>《二十年战争中的苏尼亚岛》、《百年恩怨：帝国与家族的想象共同体》、《黑铁纪元：现代国家的政治寓言》</>……"] = "There are actually so many references? <P_Yellow> 'Sonia Island in the Twenty-Year War', 'A Century of Grudges: The Imagined Community of Empire and Family', 'The Black Iron Era: Political Allegories of Modern States' </>...",
