    ["组队样式"] = "Team Style",
    ["老尼尔并没有用捡到的钱去还债，克莱恩对他的道德品质有了全新的认知。\n\n当然，他印象更深刻的还是用魔法解决的账单。"] = "Old Neil didn't use the money he found to pay off his debts, and Klein gained a brand new understanding of his moral character. \n\nOf course, what left a deeper impression on him was the bill settled with magic.",
    ["股市？股市确实是一个国家的经济晴雨表，常话怎么说来着，投资需谨慎，入市有风险。"] = "The stock market? The stock market is indeed an economic barometer of a country. As the saying goes, investment requires caution, and there are risks in entering the market.",
